AirDropPlus-Go is an independent Go reimplementation inspired by AirDropPlus
(https://github.com/yeyt97/AirDropPlus), originally copyright (c) 2023
yeytytytytyytyt and distributed under the MIT License.

No Python source code is included. The legacy HTTP compatibility layer follows
the public AirDropPlus API documentation so its signed iOS Shortcut can be used.

The Windows package includes Bitstream Charter font files from
https://github.com/davidseegert/Bitstream-Charter. Their original license and
copyright notice are preserved in assets/fonts/Charter-LICENSE.txt and in the
distributed fonts/Charter-LICENSE.txt file.
